SUMMARY:Your Resume & AI
DESCRIPTION:Internship and job-search season has begun! Are you returning
  to Bloomington with a resume that needs an update but not sure how to us
 e ChatGPT effectively?Your Resume &amp\; AIwill teach you how to use gene
 rative AI as a practical career tool while keeping your resume tailored t
 o your goals.You'll learn how to:Write effective prompts that produce use
 ful resume feedbackTransform experiences into clear\, accomplishment-focu
 sed bullet points that don't say computer writtenTailor your resume to sp
 ecific internships and job descriptionsIdentify relevant skills and keywo
 rds without copying or exaggeratingReview AI-generated content for accura
 cy\, professionalism\, and authenticityProtect your privacy and avoid com
 mon mistakes when using ChatGPTWho Should Attend:Returning students from 
 any major who want to strengthen their resume\, use AI responsibly\, and 
 gain a competitive edge in the internship or job-search process. Examples
  will be geared towards business + tech-oriented resumes.  This event is 
 Momentum eligible.
