SUMMARY:Food for Thought Info Session with FAST Enterprise
DESCRIPTION:Learn about the company and current opportunities for Impleme
 ntation Consultants\, Tech Team members\, and Training Coordinators.  Hea
 r firsthand what skills they are looking for and how to make your resume 
 stand out.  Recruiting for Math\, Statistics\, and Economics.  About FAST
 : Build technology that improves the lives of millions of people! At FAST
 \, you'll help modernize government software that powers systems people r
 ely on every day. Whether it's tax processing\, drivers and vehicle servi
 ces\, unemployment insurance\, or child support programs\, you will be im
 proving the way that governments serve their communities.  You'll work di
 rectly with clients\, solve complex business and technical challenges\, a
 nd take on meaningful responsibility early in your career. Instead of bei
 ng one small piece of a project\, you'll participate in the full software
  implementation lifecycle: gathering requirements\, configuring solutions
 \, testing functionality\, training users\, and supporting successful go-
 lives.  We look for individuals who are curious\, adaptable\, and strong 
 communicators. Because much of our work takes place alongside our clients
 \, employees should be open to relocating and embracing new opportunities
  throughout their careers.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Learn about the company and current opp
 ortunities for Implementation Consultants\, Tech Team members\, and Train
 ing Coordinators.</p><p>  Hear firsthand what skills they are looking for
  and how to make your resume stand out.</p><p>  Recruiting for Math\, Sta
 tistics\, and Economics.</p><p>  About FAST: Build technology that improv
 es the lives of millions of people! At FAST\, you'll help modernize gover
 nment software that powers systems people rely on every day. Whether it's
  tax processing\, drivers and vehicle services\, unemployment insurance\,
  or child support programs\, you will be improving the way that governmen
 ts serve their communities.<br /><br />  You'll work directly with client
 s\, solve complex business and technical challenges\, and take on meaning
 ful responsibility early in your career. Instead of being one small piece
  of a project\, you'll participate in the full software implementation li
 fecycle: gathering requirements\, configuring solutions\, testing functio
 nality\, training users\, and supporting successful go-lives.<br /><br />
   We look for individuals who are curious\, adaptable\, and strong commun
 icators. Because much of our work takes place alongside our clients\, emp
 loyees should be open to relocating and embracing new opportunities throu
 ghout their careers.</p>
