 or positions at the Department of State\, including Principal Deputy Dire
 ctor and a Member of the Policy Planning Staff. He was the Founding Dean 
 of the Hamilton Lugar School of Global and International Studies at India
 na University from 2014 to 2022. Ambassador Feinstein is a member of the 
 Council on Foreign Relations and the American Academy of Diplomacy\, and 
 holds a JD from Georgetown University Law Center.
