DESCRIPTION:Kelley Hardesty Smith and Co. is a full-service CPA and busin
 ess advisory firm serving clients throughout Indiana and the surrounding 
 states. Founded in 1970\, the firm provides accounting\, tax\, advisory\,
  and financial services to individuals and privately held businesses.  Re
 presentatives will be available to discuss the firm's culture\, career pa
 ths in public accounting and advisory services\, internship and full-time
  opportunities\, and the recruiting process.  Whether you're interested i
 n accounting\, finance\, consulting\, or business advisory services\, thi
 s is an excellent opportunity to expand your professional network\, ask q
 uestions\, and learn from experienced professionals.  No registration is 
 required—stop by anytime between 11:00 a.m. and 1:00 p.m.
