 erience fits your degree\, drop in&#160\;for a fast-tracked 15-minute tun
 e-up session.  In Just 15 Minutes:Free Professional Headshot for LinkedIn
 \, Handshake &amp\; applications  Resume Feedback geared toward internshi
 ps\, government\, NGOs &amp\; policy careers    D.C. Program Match with t
 he HLS Washington\, D.C. Global Policy Program (https://hls.indiana.edu/c
 areers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html) – explore how this opportun
 ity opens doors to high-impact internships and career networks in the nat
 ion's capital.      Claim Your Spot:Reserve Time Slot: Complete the regis
