SUMMARY:Your DC Moment | Dinner with Ambassador and Professor Lee Feinstein
DESCRIPTION:Attend an exclusive working dinner and strategy session for t
 he Spring 2027 D.C. Global Policy Program. Don't just study global leader
 ship. Put it into practice.  This intimate event is for students interest
 ed in the Hamilton Lugar Spring 2027 residency. It's a working dinner and
