  and international relief. Serving 14 years in theSenior Executive Servic
 ewithin the Department of State's Bureau of Population\, Refugees\, and M
 igration (PRM)\, Paula oversaw budgets exceeding$4 billionfor global disa
 ster and refugee assistance.      The Highlights:    First American Rappo
 rteur for the UN High Commissioner for Refugees (UNHCR).        Led inter
 agency strategy across the Department of State and USAID.            Help
 ed set global standards for international refugee protection across Afric
 a and worldwide.            Recipient of the Secretary of State'sCareer A
 chievement Award.
