SUMMARY:Mock Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:Open to all students!  Curious about what to expect at a care
 er fair? Stop by this interactive mock career fair to practice navigating
  the experience in a low-pressure setting. Staff from IU Career Centers a
 nd campus offices will serve as mock employers\, giving you the chance to
  practice introductions\, ask questions\, and learn strategies for making
  the most of a career fair.  You'll leave with practical tips\, greater c
 onfidence\, and a better idea of what to expect when attending a real car
 eer fair.  This is a drop-in\, in-person event\, so come by whenever it w
 orks for your schedule!
