SUMMARY:Summer 2027 D.C. Global Policy Program Virtual Call out meeting -
  Fast-Track Your D.C. Policy Career & Network
DESCRIPTION:Interested in spending Summer 2027 building your professional
  network in Washington\, D.C.?Join program leaders for a virtual informat
 ion session to discover how the Hamilton Lugar Washington\, D.C. Global P
 olicy Program connects IU students with high-impact policy workshops\, si
 te visits\, and career immersion in the nation's capital.Program Highligh
 ts &amp\; Key Dates:Program Dates: Summer term runs approximately May 27 
 – July 17.Application Deadline: Summer applications are due February 15
 .Career &amp\; Academic Immersion: Engage in policy seminars\, network wi
 th senior practitioners\, and receive personalized coaching on resumes\, 
 outreach\, and optional internship searches.Q&amp\;A Session: Get direct 
 answers from program staff about academic credit\, housing at Crimson Row
 \, and application requirements.How to Join:  Click the Zoom link at 12:0
 0 PM on Wednesday\, January 20 to join the live virtual session.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p data-path-to-node="16">  Interested in sp
 ending Summer 2027 building your professional network in Washington\, D.C
 .?</p><p id="p-rc_f44a47072e9bdfb3-34" data-path-to-node="17"><span data-
 path-to-node="17\,0">Join program leaders for a virtual information sessi
 on to discover how the <strong data-path-to-node="17\,0" data-index-in-no
 de="75">Hamilton Lugar Washington\, D.C. Global Policy Program</strong> c
